9:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":"These cookies are required for the site to function. They cannot be disabled while still using the site. Examples include authentication tokens for your account session, the cart-state identifier, and CSRF protection tokens for checkout. The legal basis for these cookies is contractual necessity; consent is not required."}]
a:["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-[18px] font-medium leading-tight text-[var(--text)] mt-7 mb-2","children":"2.2 Functional"}]
b:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":"These cookies remember preferences you have set, such as theme choice, region selection, or notification dismissal state. They improve the experience but are not strictly required to operate the site. The legal basis is consent, where applicable."}]
c:["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-[18px] font-medium leading-tight text-[var(--text)] mt-7 mb-2","children":"2.3 Analytics"}]
d:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":"These cookies record aggregated, de-identified usage patterns so we can improve the site. We use Sentry for error monitoring and a privacy-respecting analytics provider (Plausible or Vercel Analytics) for traffic analysis. We do not use Google Analytics. The legal basis is consent, where applicable."}]
e:["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-[18px] font-medium leading-tight text-[var(--text)] mt-7 mb-2","children":"2.4 Marketing"}]
f:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":["We do not currently set marketing or advertising cookies. We do not share data with third-party advertising networks. The only marketing identifier ","vialchemlabs"," uses is the affiliate-program promo-code linkage, which records the referring affiliate ID against the order at checkout and only when the buyer arrives via an affiliate link."]}]
10:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium leading-tight text-[var(--text)] mt-12 mb-4","children":"3. Consent"}]
11:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":"Where required by your jurisdiction (for example, the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom, or California), we present a cookie-consent interface on first visit. You can:"}]
12:["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-5 marker:text-[var(--text-subtle)]","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Accept all categories."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Customize selections by category."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Reject non-essential categories."}]]}]
13:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":"Strictly necessary cookies are set regardless of your selection because the site cannot function without them. All other categories are off by default until you opt in."}]
14:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium leading-tight text-[var(--text)] mt-12 mb-4","children":"4. Withdrawing or Changing Consent"}]
15:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":["You may change your cookie preferences at any time by visiting the cookie management page at ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/legal/cookies","className":"text-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-2 hover:text-[var(--accent-soft)] hover:underline transition-colors","children":"/legal/cookies"}]," ","or by clearing the cookies stored by your browser for"," ","vialchemlabs.com"," and revisiting the site. Browser-level controls also let you delete or block cookies, though doing so may break sign-in, cart, and checkout functionality."]}]
16:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium leading-tight text-[var(--text)] mt-12 mb-4","children":"5. Retention"}]
17:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":"Cookies have varying durations. Session cookies are deleted when you close the browser. Persistent cookies have an expiration date set when they are placed; we use durations of up to 12 months for functional and analytics cookies, and shorter durations for authentication and CSRF tokens."}]
18:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium leading-tight text-[var(--text)] mt-12 mb-4","children":"6. Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control"}]
19:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":"We honor the Global Privacy Control (GPC) signal where it indicates an opt-out of non-essential tracking, treating it as a withdrawal of consent for analytics and functional cookies. Browser-level \"Do Not Track\" (DNT) signals are not standardized; we do not currently treat DNT alone as an opt-out, but we do respect GPC."}]
